  "source_sha256": "1b924fa4db5a28820fab7249745dd063be6bf29d3102932aca170755da26bc07",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "34431272fc08246c4e37594094610e37d06f937752821636f2c67f2660fe0bb8",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nTiny Tomatoes",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bd79d81e689184c5d823ba1c0a153410d3168e59b079102d10198a9df009dde7",
      "text": "Wukong found a sunny spot.\nIt was by his front door.\n“Let’s grow tiny tomatoes!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2e7eb67cf7104dc68668ae169881c0601c78e1982d8cc0d3debc2c028e9cea43",
      "text": "Ao Bing brought two plants.\nThey dug two little holes.\n“One for you. One for me!”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a1f01bf6fbfea2ca359e4a6aeb10593038d9f9c6161423fa814d707a93b169d",
      "text": "They put the plants in.\nPat, pat. They patted the soil.\nWukong patted his tummy, too.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1ae6125b514ea178b68001f70c1ff21383ab17f790d20f43838f8309995c7c2f",
      "text": "Wukong tipped his can.\n“A drink for you...”\nOops! A drink for his shoe!\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b4982a89abc4a5eb7ed8592afb3e8fb7f8dac3ea446028286cf0181554443eb",
      "text": "Ao Bing made a tiny cloud. Drip,\ndrip, drip. “Gentle rain!” said\nWukong.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d825f24940217ad4967ed021b10ffde2b06c09387e9fd4988336c2eb36e4359f",
      "text": "Each day, they checked the soil.\nDry? A little drink.\nDamp? Time to play!\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0a3d993c4b113877569667c3d4efac49dea537d1b914b2652943096f7e599d64",
      "text": "“Red yet?” asked Wukong.\nHe looked under the leaves.\nAo Bing found Wukong’s nose!\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "82ae22408e293df03c346ffb8d5a902bf3da3f43a0a809a620aebe4249f79a22",
      "text": "Days went by.\nLittle yellow flowers opened.\n“Hello, tiny stars!”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc67412879e155a0be6a6e8c371fdc68b3b32cd82d5724155ea171028f290979",
      "text": "Then came tiny green tomatoes.\n“Ready?” asked Wukong.\n“Not yet,” said Ao Bing.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e39d8aa1c20eff72180ab2ff1a6c5fb2ec32492a65a31358280997ccb76f823",
      "text": "“Please turn red!”\nWukong waited. No answer.\nNot even a peep.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "74620fef7038befc19c170846168198f5fa7653d8f61f0a8743475758db75223",
      "text": "They watered. They waited.\nGreen turned to gold.\nGold turned to orange.\n“Almost!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "241dc061aafa92d0acedc1e45f3f9ffbf6f1765606fe40388b6a134c72919e20",
      "text": "One morning... red!\nBright, shiny, tomato red!\nWukong did a tiny tomato dance.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2152f8577586e76799b1bea3884ecf844f31b5ad89e09349e07f12a4303d3003",
      "text": "Twist, lift, plop.\nThey picked the red ones.\nThe green ones stayed to grow.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08ffe5492e5c60f3e705e7e2c081f4d233dd1dd92988ef947a80acad32357525",
      "text": "They washed the tomatoes.\nRed tomatoes. Cool water.\n“Now we can taste them!”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7877137753dfa4623919daaff5665b9427ff81c1e2c85c9231617332286f5e4c",
      "text": "They shared sweet tomato bites.\n“We grew these,” said Wukong.\nAo Bing smiled. “Together.”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
